Export the licence text

The module's BUILD file keeps its LICENSE private, so no licence declaration
can point at it.

The patch adds two lines to the module's BUILD file and carries the six
around them, too little of the file to attribute.

License: Apache-2.0 (Bazel Central Registry overlay of zstd 1.5.7.bcr.1)

--- a/BUILD.bazel
+++ b/BUILD.bazel
@@ -4,6 +4,8 @@
 
 package(default_visibility = ["//visibility:public"])
 
+exports_files(["LICENSE"])
+
 filegroup(
     name = "common_sources",
     srcs = glob([
